  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY插珠城堡帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "DIY Fort Castle Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童DIY插珠城堡帐篷拼搭套装，采用PP材质，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n产品归类为14岁以下玩具，产地东莞茶山，覆盖欧洲、南美、东南亚、北美、东北亚和中东等市场。",
    "en": "This is a kids DIY bead-and-rod fort castle building set made of PP material, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nIt is categorized as an under-14 toy, produced in Chashan, Dongguan, and supplied to Europe, South America, Southeast Asia, North America, Northeast Asia, and the Middle East."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY插珠城堡帐篷拼搭套装采用模块化拼搭结构，支持围绕帐篷、城堡和通道进行多形态设计，适合儿童连续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、课程教具和活动场景布置，可用于空间认知、动手能力和协作玩法训练。",
      "包装为彩盒，规格为2-3M，配套重量参数清晰，便于渠道上架、仓配管理与项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY fort castle building set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layout designs around tent, castle, and tunnel themes for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event setup scenarios, helping with spatial learning, hands-on practice, and collaborative play.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging with a 2-3M specification and clear weight data, making it suitable for channel listing, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
